{"reference":"1 Chronicles 13","book":"1 Chronicles","chapter":13,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"historical_context","title":"The Ark’s Later Handling","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"The chapter records a failed attempt to bring the ark to David’s city. The account’s later continuation is described as assigning priests and Levites to carry it according to the prescribed order and establishing continuing worship before it.","verse_refs":["1 Chronicles 13:1-14"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_1_chronicles_013_c7f4e7252bd34409e5ff89c6"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}